// __nUlakam/nAtkAtti/nAL.qmz — நாள், the calendar itself__
// நாள்: நாட்காட்டியே
//
// __Dates are ISO-8601 text, "YYYY-MM-DD", which sorts chronologically — so__
// __comparison, ordering and "is it in this period" need no arithmetic at all__
// __and live in kaNakkiyal/kAlam.qmz. What needs arithmetic is everything else,__
// __and the host provides exactly three primitives:__
//
//     __இன்று()                      today, in UTC__
//     __நாள்_வேறுபாடு(அ, ஆ)          whole days from அ to ஆ, negative if earlier__
//     __நாள்_கூட்டு(நாள், நாட்கள்)    a date shifted by whole days__
//
// __Everything here is built from those three. A month is not a fixed number of__
// __days and a year is not 365, so anything stated in months or years — an__
// __instalment date, a period of holding, interest "for every month or part of__
// __a month" — cannot be computed by dividing days by 30. That division is what__
// __this module exists to replace.__
//
// __**The host does not reject an impossible date.** நாள்_கூட்டு("2026-02-31", 0)__
// __answers "2026-03-03": the parser checks only that the month is 1-12 and the__
// __day 1-31, then rolls the overflow forward. So a date that came from outside__
// __the program has to go through நாள்_செல்லுபடியா before it is trusted, and__
// __that function deliberately does its own shape and range checks *before*__
// __handing anything to the host — because a month of 13 is not a தவறு there, it__
// __is a runtime error that stops the program.__
//
// __**Everything below assumes a valid date**, exactly as kAlam.qmz does.__
// __Validating inside every function would mean every function returned a__
// __Result, and a calendar whose every call has to be unwrapped is a calendar__
// __nobody will use. Validate at the edge — where the date arrives from a user,__
// __a file or a database — and the arithmetic stays readable.__
//
// __Weekdays are numbered **0 = Sunday** through 6 = Saturday, which is the__
// __numbering ISO-8601's own week rules are least like; it is chosen because__
// __மீதி is floor-based and this keeps the arithmetic free of adjustments.__
// __வாரநாள்_பெயர் exists so no caller has to remember it.__
//
// __Years outside 0001-9999 are not representable in the four-digit form and are__
// __not supported.__

இறக்கு "../atippatY/kaNiqam.qmz";
இறக்கு "../atippatY/col.qmz";

// __Split into the files below. This one keeps the name so that every__
// __`இறக்கு` of it still reaches every function it used to.__

இறக்கு "caripArppu.qmz";
இறக்கு "mAqam.qmz";
இறக்கு "vAram.qmz";
